* f_analog_block_bsim3 -- 60 independent 5T-OTA cells = 300 BSIM3 instances
* (ngspice_augmentation card #467/#478/#483, plan T9.1/T9.2/T9.3; generated
* by bench/gen_analog_block.py --tstop-ns 2000.0 --device bsim3
* -- do not hand-edit, regenerate instead). Synthetic textbook OTA array,
* synthetic, not derived from any real design.
* run: ngspice -b <this file> (writes to
*  ~/Work/data/ngspice_augmentation/accel/bench/f_analog_block_bsim3/, never
*  into the repo)

.param vdd_v=3.3 vcm=1.65

.model nch3 nmos level=49 version=3.3.0
+ tox=3.5e-9 nch=2.4e17 nsub=5e16
+ vth0=0.5 u0=300 vsat=1.1e5

.model pch3 pmos level=49 version=3.3.0
+ tox=3.5e-9 nch=2.5e17 nsub=5e16
+ vth0=-0.5 u0=100 vsat=1.0e5

Vdd vdd 0 DC {vdd_v}
Vcm vcm 0 DC {vcm}
Vbias_tail vbias_tail 0 DC 1.0
Rbias vbias_tail 0 1Meg

* --- cell 0: 5T OTA (M1/M2 diff pair, M3/M4 PMOS mirror load, M5 NMOS tail) ---
Vinp0 inp0 0 PULSE({vcm} 1.700000 200n 5n 5n 800n 2000n)
M1_0 outn0 inp0 tail0 0 nch3 w=4u l=0.5u
M2_0 out0 vcm tail0 0 nch3 w=4u l=0.5u
M3_0 outn0 outn0 vdd vdd pch3 w=8u l=0.5u
M4_0 out0 outn0 vdd vdd pch3 w=8u l=0.5u
M5_0 tail0 vbias_tail 0 0 nch3 w=8u l=1u
Cload0 out0 0 200f
